cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BoliviaQuarcs: Harmonized Municipal Population Panel of Bolivia (1992, 2001, 2012, and 2024) on 339 Geo4Bolivia Reference Polygons"
message: "If you use this software or harmonized dataset, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Leiva
    given-names: Favio
repository-code: "https://github.com/Favioleiva/BoliviaQuarcs"
url: "https://github.com/Favioleiva/BoliviaQuarcs"
license: MIT
date-released: "2026-11-19"
abstract: >-
  Harmonized municipal population panel for Bolivia across the 1992, 2001, 2012,
  and 2024 censuses on 339 Geo4Bolivia reference polygons, with a bilingual
  (Spanish/English) interactive dashboard, geographic crosswalks, and
  documentation. Underlying INE census data, Geo4Bolivia/SDSN boundaries, and
  third-party visual assets retain their respective original licenses and terms.
